      "summary": "Locational marginal prices by pricing node, with the congestion and loss components a member agreement covers.",
      "description": "Hourly and five-minute locational marginal prices for every CAISO pricing node, including the congestion and marginal-loss decomposition that the public OASIS feed does not carry. Access to the extended attributes is governed by a member agreement; the record exists publicly because knowing this dataset exists is not itself restricted, and a modeller who needs it should be able to find out who to ask.",
